  m_Name: 06_RecoverOxygenPlant
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpaceGame.Gameplay.Objectives.RecoverOxygenPlantStep
  id: recover-oxygen-plant
  title: Recover the oxygen plant
  briefing:
  - Hold on. Cabin air is gone. The back door burst open when we hit, and the oxygen
    plant went out through it.
  - It's lying on the sand behind us. Grab its handle and drag it back to its mount,
    then give it a power cell. Two of you will haul it faster.
  lookAtFocus: 1
  outsideStatus: Thrown out of the back door. Grab its handle
  haulingStatus: Hauling  <b>{0:0} m</b> to its mount
  powerStatus: In its mount. Fit a power cell
  beaconLift: 1.5
